      long_en: "FITASC is the International Federation of Hunting-Style Sport Shooting. It writes the rules for FITASC Sporting and Compak Sporting, approves international competitions such as Grand Prix events, World Cup stages and the European and World Championships, and licenses referees. National federations are members of FITASC. The Olympic disciplines Trap and Skeet are governed by a different body, ISSF.",
