      long_en: "A cage is a metal or wooden frame built around the peg. Its uprights and bars block the barrels from pointing towards paths, other stands or spectators, so a shooter cannot follow a target too far. Cages are typical on stands placed close to each other or near public areas. For the shooter it also shows where the safe shooting arc ends.",
