      long_en: "On each stand the safe shooting area is limited by markers — poles, flags or the posts of a cage. Shooting outside these limits is a safety offence. Under FITASC rules a target may also have to be shot within a defined zone, and a target engaged outside it can be scored as lost. The referee explains the limits during the target showing.",
